  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caira Organization Grant - re-coding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Irish Representative Office in Ramallah, through the Palestine Head of Mission Fund, will support Caira Organisation, aiming to support&#xa0;training women on gender-based violence (GBV), sexual assault prevention, and legal rights across two centers (Birzeit and Jalazone RC), while introducing foundational GBV awareness in a new center (Qalandiya). Interactive theater activities for children in Birzeit and Jalazone will teach safety and reporting mechanisms. The project will produce two short films and a guidebook&#x2014;now co-developed with Caira Organization&#x2014;to amplify reach. Direct beneficiaries include 90 women (30 per center) and 100 children, with indirect impact for 1,500+ community members.</narrative>
  </description>
